      "paragraphs": [
        "The Maple Leafs spent Saturday in Arizona supporting Matthew Mayich and his family before practice, a quiet gesture ahead of Tuesday night's season opener against the Canadiens on Sportsnet. That same careful tone fits the Blue Jays, who dropped 5-1 to the Reds last night and finish their season today at 3:07 p.m. ET on Sportsnet with Max Scherzer expected to start.",
